<h2 class="pt-4 text-white text-4xl text-center font-light">Why Golfers Love Carl's&nbsp;Place</h2>
<div class="container flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center text-white text-center py-6 md:py-12">
<div class="p-4 md:px-8 flex flex-col items-center"><img src="https://www.carlofet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/easy-installation-icon.png?width=100&amp;height=100&amp;name=easy-installation-icon.png" alt="easy-installation-icon" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" style="height: auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100px;" srcset="https://www.carlofet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/easy-installation-icon.png?width=50&amp;height=50&amp;name=easy-installation-icon.png 50w, https://www.carlofet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/easy-installation-icon.png?width=100&amp;height=100&amp;name=easy-installation-icon.png 100w, https://www.carlofet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/easy-installation-icon.png?width=150&amp;height=150&amp;name=easy-installation-icon.png 150w, https://www.carlofet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/easy-installation-icon.png?width=200&amp;height=200&amp;name=easy-installation-icon.png 200w, https://www.carlofet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/easy-installation-icon.png?width=250&amp;height=250&amp;name=easy-installation-icon.png 250w, https://www.carlofet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/easy-installation-icon.png?width=300&amp;height=300&amp;name=easy-installation-icon.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px">
